OL,3,ASpanish transport minister resigns days
OL,4,Aafter deadly train crash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A transport minister in a country like
OL,7,FSpain cannot remain in office after two
OL,8,Faccidents of this seriousness in less
OL,9,Fthan a year," he said, also referring
OL,10,Fto a deadly crash in January in
OL,11,FAndalusia, southern Spain.
OL,13,FThe latest tragedy in Urda happened
OL,14,Fwhen a state-operated Renfe high-speed
OL,15,Ftrain smashed into the back of another
OL,16,Fstationary train operated by the Iryo
OL,17,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
